{"channelId":"UCf0d4zTBodrMfwqJgYd467w","row":["Equine Athletes Veterinary Physiotherapy",55,"Equine Athletes Veterinary Physiotherapy\n\n​Professional Veterinary Physiotherapy for performance, maintenance, and recovery. Based in Grantham, we provide mobile services across Lincolnshire and Nottinghamshire, specialising in evidence-based care for the equine athlete. 🐎\n\n​🏥 Rehab Yard: We offer dedicated inpatient rehabilitation at our yard near Grantham for intensive recovery, fitness programmes, and post-surgical care.\n\n​📧 Bookings & Enquiries: We are currently managing all bookings via social media. For a faster response, please message us directly on Facebook or Instagram!\n\n​👇 Follow our journey:\n\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/share/18AYPNieqm/\n\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/equineathletesuk","",""],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCf0d4zTBodrMfwqJgYd467w","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCf0d4zTBodrMfwqJgYd467w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:57.828Z","channelId":"UCf0d4zTBodrMfwqJgYd467w","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7f91c22b3600dc50633607c4f64ebfa330a58f32f2143d7da3427e61b7cbca99","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"28cbd7ec76e39139c9589f3e813af7edf00864a13e53d9848ba5579cd8d8cdfe"},"countrySource":{},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCf0d4zTBodrMfwqJgYd467w","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":55,"raw":"55 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCf0d4zTBodrMfwqJgYd467w","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:06:57.828Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"physical therapist","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel":"profile","role":"undetermined","flags":[],"sourceUrls":["https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCf0d4zTBodrMfwqJgYd467w"]}],"cleanup":{"status":"review","code":"biography_audience_review","reason":"简介上下文未证明本人